      "created": 1784969509,
      "updated": 1784969509
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64794100000000000dbeeb",
      "text": " なぜルールを守らないのか",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1784969538,
      "updated": 1784969544
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64794200000000000dbeec",
      "text": "  1. ルールを理解していない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1784969539,
      "updated": 1784969544
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64794200000000000dbeed",
      "text": "  2. ルールが現実的ではない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1784969539,
      "updated": 1784969544
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64794200000000000dbeee",
      "text": "  3. ルールが軽んじられている",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1784969539,
      "updated": 1784969544
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64794200000000000dbeef",
      "text": "  4. 信頼関係が築けていない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1784969539,
      "updated": 1784969544
    },
